<p>I am sorry, this seems like a cheap attempt to make an Author Avatar in your first article. This character is <em>immune</em> to basically all SCP anomalies AND can create anomalies which is the definition of OP.</p>
<p>I mean, he just seems like a supernatural SCP foundation.</p>
<p>I don't want to be harsh, but this doesn't interest me. I want to read stories about grounded characters with interesting motivations, that are centered around anomalies. I think you should go back to the drawing board, and think about a story you want to tell and then craft an anomaly that allows you to explore that story.</p>

